      "SurveyID": "SV_5BHV96T7cWF4lYq",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID121",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Task B. \u00a0 On the next page, you will interact with an AI partner via chats. Imagine yourself as a..",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<strong>Task B.</strong><br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nOn the next page, you will interact with an <strong>AI partner</strong> via chats. Imagine yourself as a <strong>customer who wants to sell your laptop</strong> at a good price to a used computer dealer. You will need to negotiate the price of your laptop with the dealer. The following is the information about your device, which is also shown to the dealer. You don\u2019t have to inform the dealer of the details of the laptop, but you may use it in the negotiation.<br>\n<br>\nItem: Apple MacBook Air<br>\nStorage: 128 GB<br>\nProcessor: M1 Chip<br>\nPurchase Date: April of the previous year<br>\nPurchase Price: $799<br>\nCondition: Excellent, no damage<br>\nWarranty: One year remaining<br>\nBattery Health: 90%<br>\nAccessories: Original charger, cables, and the original box<br>\nWater Exposure: None<br>Apple Cloud Lock: None<br>\n<br>\nBased on your search on the internet, the<strong> average market value </strong>of laptops with these specs would be <strong>$500</strong>. Please remember that this value is only a reference. Before you proceed, we would like you to answer a question to make sure the instructions were clear for you to understand.",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
